This repository contains the code and data used for the analysis presented in the article "Too cheap to meter? A stochastic analysis of projected future fusion costs" (by Stefania Böhnlein, Fanny Böse, Claudia Kemfert, Christian von Hirschhausen and Alexander Wimmers).
The article was submitted to iScience in June 2026.
This version represents the resubmitted version of the article as of September 2026.

Data_upload.xlsx contains all the data collected and used. These data are also provided in the supplementary material of the article itself.
The other file contains the Python code to execute the stochastic model ("MonteCarlo simulation").

All questions and comments should be directed to the corresponding author Alexander Wimmers at awi@wip.tu-berlin.de
